{
"idioms":{"theme":"Communication","items":[
{"t":"get the message across","uz":"fikrni tushuntira olmoq","ex":"Good ads get the message across in seconds.","use":"Kommunikatsiya, marketing"},
{"t":"beat around the bush","uz":"aylantirib gapirmoq, asosiy gapga o'tmaslik","ex":"Stop beating around the bush and tell me the truth.","use":"Gapirish uslubi"},
{"t":"get straight to the point","uz":"darhol asosiy gapga o'tmoq","ex":"My boss always gets straight to the point.","use":"Odamni tasvirlash"},
{"t":"on the tip of my tongue","uz":"tilimning uchida turibdi (eslay olmayapman)","ex":"His name is on the tip of my tongue.","use":"Speaking'da so'z topolmasangiz ham ishlating!"},
{"t":"hear it through the grapevine","uz":"mish-mish orqali eshitmoq","ex":"I heard it through the grapevine that she's leaving.","use":"Yangilik qanday tarqalishi"},
{"t":"talk someone into","uz":"birovni nimagadir ko'ndirmoq","ex":"My friend talked me into joining the gym.","use":"Part 2: qaror hikoyasi"},
{"t":"keep someone posted","uz":"birovni xabardor qilib turmoq","ex":"I'll keep you posted about my results.","use":"Norasmiy muloqot"},
{"t":"break the ice","uz":"tanishuvdagi noqulaylikni yo'qotmoq","ex":"Jokes are a good way to break the ice.","use":"Yangi odamlar bilan tanishish"},
{"t":"speak your mind","uz":"fikrini ochiq aytmoq","ex":"I like people who speak their mind.","use":"Xarakter tasviri"},
{"t":"a heart-to-heart","uz":"samimiy, ochiq suhbat","ex":"We had a long heart-to-heart about our future.","use":"Muhim suhbat haqida"}]},
"reading":{"items":[
{"w":"achieve","pos":"verb","syn":"accomplish, attain, reach","uz":"erishmoq","ex":"Few students achieve full marks."},
{"w":"acquire","pos":"verb","syn":"obtain, gain, get","uz":"egallamoq, qo'lga kiritmoq","ex":"Children acquire language naturally."},
{"w":"administration","pos":"noun","syn":"management, government","uz":"ma'muriyat, boshqaruv","ex":"The administration announced new reforms."},
{"w":"affect","pos":"verb","syn":"influence, have an impact on","uz":"ta'sir qilmoq","ex":"Noise can affect concentration."},
{"w":"appropriate","pos":"adj","syn":"suitable, proper, fitting","uz":"mos, munosib","ex":"Choose an appropriate method for the task."},
{"w":"aspect","pos":"noun","syn":"feature, side, element","uz":"jihat","ex":"Cost is only one aspect of the problem."},
{"w":"assist","pos":"verb","syn":"help, aid, support","uz":"yordam bermoq","ex":"Robots assist surgeons in complex operations."},
{"w":"category","pos":"noun","syn":"class, group, type","uz":"toifa","ex":"The products fall into three categories."},
{"w":"commission","pos":"verb/noun","syn":"order, request; committee","uz":"buyurtma bermoq; komissiya","ex":"The study was commissioned by the government."},
{"w":"community","pos":"noun","syn":"society, population, group","uz":"jamiyat, mahalla","ex":"Local communities were consulted about the plan."}]},
"speaking":{"theme":"Hypothetical situations","items":[
{"s":"If I had the chance, I'd …","uz":"Imkonim bo'lsa, … qilardim","ex":"If I had the chance, I'd study in Canada.","use":"2-shart gap — band 7 uchun muhim"},
{"s":"I'd probably …","uz":"Ehtimol, … qilardim","ex":"I'd probably travel around Asia first.","use":"Taxminiy javob"},
{"s":"Suppose …, I think …","uz":"Faraz qilaylik, …","ex":"Suppose cars were banned, I think people would cycle more.","use":"Part 3 da fikr yuritish"},
{"s":"If it were up to me, …","uz":"Menga qolsa edi, …","ex":"If it were up to me, I'd make museums free.","use":"Siyosat/qoida haqida savollar"},
{"s":"I wish I could …","uz":"Qani endi … qila olsam","ex":"I wish I could speak Chinese fluently.","use":"Istak, afsus"},
{"s":"If I'd known …, I would have …","uz":"Agar … bilganimda, … qilgan bo'lardim","ex":"If I'd known, I would have prepared better.","use":"3-shart gap — eng yuqori grammatika"},
{"s":"Imagine if …","uz":"Tasavvur qiling, agar …","ex":"Imagine if everyone worked from home.","use":"Part 3 ga jonli boshlanish"},
{"s":"In an ideal world, …","uz":"Ideal dunyoda, …","ex":"In an ideal world, everyone would have free healthcare.","use":"Orzu va real holatni solishtirish"},
{"s":"Assuming that …, …","uz":"… deb faraz qilsak, …","ex":"Assuming that prices stay the same, more people will buy cars.","use":"Kelajak haqida mantiqiy fikr"},
{"s":"Otherwise, …","uz":"Aks holda, …","ex":"We need cleaner energy. Otherwise, pollution will get worse.","use":"Oqibatni ko'rsatish"}]},
"pron":{"theme":"Word stress: noun vs verb","items":[
{"w":"REcord – reCORD","ipa":"/ˈrekɔːd/ – /rɪˈkɔːd/","uz":"ot — 1-bo'g'in, fe'l — 2-bo'g'in","tip":"a REcord, to reCORD"},
{"w":"PREsent – preSENT","ipa":"/ˈpreznt/ – /prɪˈzent/","uz":"sovg'a/hozirgi – taqdim etmoq","tip":"I'll preSENT my PREsent"},
{"w":"INcrease – inCREASE","ipa":"/ˈɪnkriːs/ – /ɪnˈkriːs/","uz":"Task 1 da ikkalasi ham kerak","tip":"an INcrease, to inCREASE"},
{"w":"OBject – obJECT","ipa":"/ˈɒbdʒɪkt/ – /əbˈdʒekt/","uz":"narsa – e'tiroz bildirmoq","tip":"Urg'u ma'noni o'zgartiradi"},
{"w":"PROgress – proGRESS","ipa":"/ˈprəʊɡres/ – /prəˈɡres/","uz":"taraqqiyot – rivojlanmoq","tip":"make PROgress"},
{"w":"CONtract – conTRACT","ipa":"/ˈkɒntrækt/ – /kənˈtrækt/","uz":"shartnoma – qisqarmoq/kasallikka chalinmoq","tip":"sign a CONtract"},
{"w":"PERmit – perMIT","ipa":"/ˈpɜːmɪt/ – /pəˈmɪt/","uz":"ruxsatnoma – ruxsat bermoq","tip":"a work PERmit"},
{"w":"EXport – exPORT","ipa":"/ˈekspɔːt/ – /ɪkˈspɔːt/","uz":"eksport – eksport qilmoq","tip":"Task 1 grafiklarda tez-tez"},
{"w":"DEcrease – deCREASE","ipa":"/ˈdiːkriːs/ – /dɪˈkriːs/","uz":"pasayish – pasaymoq","tip":"a DEcrease in sales"},
{"w":"CONduct – conDUCT","ipa":"/ˈkɒndʌkt/ – /kənˈdʌkt/","uz":"xulq – o'tkazmoq (tadqiqot)","tip":"conDUCT research"}]},
"task1":{"theme":"Time phrases","items":[
{"w":"over the period","syn":"throughout the period","uz":"butun davr davomida","ex":"Over the period, sales doubled."},
{"w":"between … and …","syn":"from … to …","uz":"… va … yillar orasida","ex":"Between 1990 and 2000, prices rose."},
{"w":"in the following year","syn":"a year later","uz":"keyingi yilda","ex":"In the following year, the figure fell."},
{"w":"by (+ year)","syn":"no later than","uz":"… yilga kelib","ex":"By 2020, half the population lived in cities."},
{"w":"over the next decade","syn":"during the next ten years","uz":"keyingi o'n yil davomida","ex":"Over the next decade, it rose steadily."},
{"w":"at the beginning / end of the period","syn":"initially / finally","uz":"davr boshida/oxirida","ex":"At the beginning of the period, coal dominated."},
{"w":"initially","syn":"at first, originally","uz":"dastlab","ex":"Initially, there were 200 members."},
{"w":"subsequently","syn":"afterwards, later","uz":"keyinchalik","ex":"Subsequently, numbers fell to 150."},
{"w":"thereafter","syn":"after that","uz":"shundan so'ng","ex":"The rate peaked in 2008 and fell thereafter."},
{"w":"is projected / expected to","syn":"is predicted to, is forecast to","uz":"… kutilmoqda (kelajak bashorati)","ex":"The figure is projected to reach 60% by 2040."}]},
"task2":{"theme":"Government and society","items":[
{"w":"allocate funds","syn":"distribute money, budget","uz":"mablag' ajratmoq","ex":"Governments should allocate more funds to education."},
{"w":"public services","syn":"state services","uz":"davlat xizmatlari","ex":"Taxes pay for public services."},
{"w":"infrastructure","syn":"roads, transport, utilities","uz":"infratuzilma","ex":"Poor infrastructure slows economic growth."},
{"w":"impose restrictions","syn":"introduce limits","uz":"cheklovlar joriy etmoq","ex":"The state should impose restrictions on advertising."},
{"w":"subsidise","syn":"fund, support financially","uz":"subsidiya bermoq","ex":"Public transport should be subsidised."},
{"w":"welfare system","syn":"social security","uz":"ijtimoiy ta'minot tizimi","ex":"A strong welfare system protects the poor."},
{"w":"income inequality","syn":"the wealth gap","uz":"daromadlar tengsizligi","ex":"Income inequality has grown in many countries."},
{"w":"civic responsibility","syn":"duty as a citizen","uz":"fuqarolik burchi","ex":"Voting is a civic responsibility."},
{"w":"raise awareness","syn":"inform, educate the public","uz":"xabardorlikni oshirmoq","ex":"Campaigns can raise awareness of road safety."},
{"w":"the authorities","syn":"the government, officials","uz":"rasmiylar, hokimiyat","ex":"The authorities must take action quickly."}]}
}
